    <legal:text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">60. Amendment of 39 of 1987.— The Legal Services Authorities Act, 1987,shall be amended in the
manner specified in the Fifth Schedule.</legal:text>
  </rdf:Description>
