    <legal:text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">61. Amendment of 26 of 1996.—The Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996, shall be amended in the
manner specified in the Sixth Schedule.</legal:text>
  </rdf:Description>
