    <legal:text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">62.Amendment of 27 of 2006.—The Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Development Act, 2006,
shall be amended in the manner specified in the Seventh Schedule.</legal:text>
