    <legal:text rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">9. Facilities to be afforded to Commissioners.—A railway administration shall afford to the
Commissioner all reasonable facilities for the discharge of the duties or for the exercise of the powers
imposed or conferred on him by or under this Act.</legal:text>
